e. Every player of a club moves by one whole number and its best few by one more, held to 1–99 and never past a teammate rated above him, whichever brings the club nearest its target: −4 to +4 points this season. The results count twice, by design: the credit's points for and against place a club's players at their positions and weigh its offence against its defence, and the move then sets the club's level from its margins, wherever the credit left it. Facts from Pro Football Archives; the weights tuned once on 2001–2005 against the next season's Madden launch ratings, then frozen."},"map":"nfl1976","clubs":[{"id":"nfl-miami-dolphins","name":"Miami Dolphins","code":"MIA","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 61)","str":83.6,"squad":[["Don Strock","QB",77],["Bob Griese","QB",76],["Delvin Williams","RB",97],["Leroy Harris","RB",81],["Nat Moore","WR",92],["Duriel Harris","WR",83],["Jimmy Cefalo","WR",73],["Andre Tillman","TE",84],["Loaird McCreary","TE",66],["Jim Langer","OL",99],["Bob Kuechenberg","OL",85],["Larry Little","OL",85],["Mike Current","OL",85],["Ed Newman","OL",68],["Wayne Moore","OL",68],["Eric Laakso","OL",58],["Vern Den Herder","DL",91],["A.J. Duhe","DL",79],["Bob Baumhower","DL",78],["Doug Betters","DL",71],["Carl Barisich","DL",64],["John Alexander","DL",57],["Kim Bokamper","LB",96],["Larry Gordon","LB",94],["Rusty Chambers","LB",78],["Norris Thomas","CB",78],["Curtis Johnson","CB",73],["Gerald Small","CB",72],["Charles Cornelius","CB",65],["Tim Foley","S",87],["Rick Volk","S",76],["Charlie Babb","S",69],["Garo Yepremian","K",99]]},{"id":"nfl-dallas-cowboys","name":"Dallas Cowboys","code":"DAL","league":"NFL","country":"840","col":"oklch(0.72 0.16 44)","str":82.2,"squad":[["Roger Staubach","QB",97],["Danny White","QB",60],["Tony Dorsett","RB",92],["Robert Newhouse","RB",80],["Drew Pearson","WR",79],["Tony Hill","WR",79],["Butch Johnson","WR",65],["Robert Steele","WR",56],["Billy Joe DuPree","TE",89],["Jackie Smith","TE",62],["Herbert S